category":"Breweries","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"2MWJ928p0GRn2Q3TgvEz_w","review_id":"gpzJA_u6iC3W4BUtlLKVDg","date":"2019-09-16T18:56:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9480518102645874,"text_excerpt":"If you are a beer connoisseur or even if you're not, you will appreciate this Craft Brew Bus Tour! We had so much fun! Ryan, our guide was awesome & took us to 3 breweries (Port Orleans, NOLA Brew Co. & Miel) He was super informative and gave us suggestions on which brews to try depending on our taste buds. If you are looking for something fun to do while in this wonderful city, I would highly recommend this Brew Tour. Great for birthday parties or bachelor parties!"},{"business_id":"2MWJ928p0GRn2Q3TgvEz_w","review_id":"sBNeMe5JXUGDY_FW-ZuHAg","date":"2018-12-17T22:08:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9238378405570984,"text_excerpt":"I end up on a NOLA tour once or twice a year when we have family in town. I've been on tours with nearly every company in town. I LOVED NOLA Brew Bus! We did the ghost tour in the French Quarter. It was the perfect combination of local history and spook! Our guide, Nancy Lee was extremely sharp and never missed a beat. She was able to answer every question we had and kept the group moving in a timely manner. Nancy Lee was extremely personable, I often felt like an old friend was showing us around. I absolutely would recommend this tour company for tourists and locals alike. I know I'll be back."},{"business_id":"2MWJ928p0GRn2Q3TgvEz_w","review_id":"w4eGf_VgSBxviAdCBRnkZQ","date":"2017-09-03T05:30:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9051121473312378,"text_excerpt":"Seriously fun. The owner & creator, Matt, is such a fun person to be around and his business shines in New Orleans. If you get a chance, book a trip on the brew bus or join him during a Tailgate party for LSU & Saints season!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
